{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "df95c1a3-7879-5024-a866-f28d412e9420", "source_ordinal": 2376, "reading_ordinal": 1678, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "自重", "published_at": "2023-03-03T03:48:20+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/513840870/answer/2918887580"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "子女是父母的监护对象，其他人不能越过监护人对被监护人做任何要求。想看表演，要向父母申请，而不能直接邀请小朋友。直接问小朋友“要不要表演”，对父母是一种客观的侵犯。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 81}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这个时候，最优先的事项不是表演不表演，而是越过我向我的儿女发邀请的行为不可以被宽纵。", "char_start": 82, "char_end": 124}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "要想排除这种僭越，方法也很常规——这种越权申请，处理者很自然的要将请求转发到约定的处理窗口。", "char_start": 125, "char_end": 171}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "也就是子女只能有一个反应，就是“预约我表演要找我的老板，私下表演要扣钱的”。", "char_start": 172, "char_end": 210}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "“老板”就是父母。", "char_start": 211, "char_end": 220}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "父母这时候再把梗接住——“公司有规定，艺人没有正式出道之前不能公开表演”。", "char_start": 221, "char_end": 258}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这样，讨论的重心就转向了这个“演艺运营”的“玩笑”上了。", "char_start": 259, "char_end": 287}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "各自打趣几句“规矩这么严啊”，再引开话题就行了。", "char_start": 288, "char_end": 312}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "而这事真正的微妙之处就在于——", "char_start": 313, "char_end": 328}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这并不是个玩笑。", "char_start": 329, "char_end": 337}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "“我们家”确实是这个规矩。", "char_start": 338, "char_end": 351}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "一切私下表演邀请，一概请转发到正确的处理窗口。不管是你大伯在过年时要你表演也罢，你的同学过生日也罢，你们自己去唱卡拉ok表演着玩也罢，都必须经过我的批准。", "char_start": 353, "char_end": 430}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "如果你真的尊重你自己的专业，那么这就是基本的专业性，不是借口。", "char_start": 431, "char_end": 462}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "保持这种专业的严肃态度，是一种自重。", "char_start": 463, "char_end": 481}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "没有这点专业性，你自己就会把那些练习、考核当作随时可以糊弄、调笑的“业余娱乐”。", "char_start": 482, "char_end": 522}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这些东西，真正的乐趣都在专业入门之后，你吊儿郎当当取乐，将很快因为缺少真功夫、反复在门槛上绊倒而最终失去兴趣。", "char_start": 523, "char_end": 578}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你以为这个世界上有多少值得感兴趣的真专业？", "char_start": 579, "char_end": 600}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这是稀缺而难以再生的资源，糟蹋一个少一个。", "char_start": 601, "char_end": 622}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "而不按这规矩来，就是在糟蹋。", "char_start": 623, "char_end": 637}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "按规矩来，“亲戚逼表演”这个问题根本就不存在。", "char_start": 638, "char_end": 661}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 23}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0256"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：孩子过年和大人们一起吃饭，突然让娃表演才艺，怎样巧妙地帮孩子拒绝掉？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020"], "summary": "围绕“自重”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“子女是父母的监护对象，其他人不能越过监护人对被监护人做任何要求。想看表演，要向父母申请，而不能直接邀请小朋友。直接问小朋友“要不要表演”，对父母是一种客观的侵犯。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "子女是父母的监护对象，其他人不能越过监护人对被监护人做任何要求。想看表演，要向父母申请，而不能直接邀请小朋友。直接问小朋友“要不要表演”，对父母是一种客观的侵犯。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 81, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "26b0ac95-c66e-5b6d-b6ea-102a9e099f52", "source_ordinal": 2375, "reading_ordinal": 1679, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "不问原因", "published_at": "2023-03-03T18:00:32+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/21236814/answer/2919907790"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "老实说，“为什么有的人xxx”这系列的问题，根本是没法回答的。因为人做事的动机过于复杂，而且人也显然不总是明智和理性的，这类问题根本就没有什么确定的答案。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 77}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "其实，严格的一夫一妻制几乎是罗马化基督教（公教、正教、新教）的专利。", "char_start": 78, "char_end": 112}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "犹太教、罗马化之前的早期基督教、伊斯兰教、印度教、儒教这些世界主流宗教，都是没有这么坚决而严格的一夫一妻制观念的。", "char_start": 113, "char_end": 170}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这是个非常简单、有充分证据的客观事实。", "char_start": 171, "char_end": 190}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "对“一夫一妻制”的坚定信念和高度的道德化，是近现代以基督教为底色的西方文化完成全球统治后才形成的非常新的现象。几千年来，人类社会里一男多女的关系形式并不奇怪。", "char_start": 191, "char_end": 270}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "所以，不要这么大惊小怪。", "char_start": 271, "char_end": 283}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你如果不接受这件事情，那么你首要的工作是做好如果它发生时的必要安排——例如保持你的经济独立和社会关系独立，使得转向独立生活不会变得太困难甚至不可想象。", "char_start": 285, "char_end": 360}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "不建议你尝试用“发动社会谴责以威慑住对方，使其不敢妄动”这样的做法。因为这是一个投入巨大、会造成很大的安全幻觉，然而却几乎没有什么实际效果的做法。", "char_start": 361, "char_end": 434}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "很多人把主要精力放在这方面，占用了原本应该用在自身建设和经营上的精力和资源。结果事情发生了，自己接受不了，却因为自己缺少独立生活的能力而不能不“现实一点”。", "char_start": 435, "char_end": 513}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这反而是最坏的结果。", "char_start": 514, "char_end": 524}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "有些事情，没有必要问原因。", "char_start": 525, "char_end": 538}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "它发生了，这并不意味着你就有什么错。", "char_start": 539, "char_end": 557}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这并不意味着你“如果更漂亮一些就好了”，或者“更会撒娇一些就好了”，或者“看得更严一些就好了”。", "char_start": 558, "char_end": 606}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你只要这次尽力而为了，那么你就没什么可追悔莫及的错。", "char_start": 607, "char_end": 633}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "不需要把能量浪费在这些无谓的“找到原因”上。", "char_start": 634, "char_end": 656}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你当然是需要持续自我改进的，但并不能改进到让别人不会起其它念头的程度，这个既不现实、也无必要。", "char_start": 657, "char_end": 704}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "当聚则聚，当散则散，这是人间的常态，与其将有限的精力放在如何控制聚散上，不如将精力放在整理自身的结构，让聚散沉浮不易伤筋动骨上，然后随它自便。", "char_start": 705, "char_end": 776}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "然后你会发现，这个轻松自如、没有焦虑的态度本身，就是人难以抗拒和割舍的魅力的一部分。", "char_start": 777, "char_end": 819}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这仍然不足以百分之百的防止移情别恋，但是老实说，防到这个程度属于性价比最高的策略了。", "char_start": 820, "char_end": 862}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "还要省下精神玩别的呢，哪那么多精力折腾这个。", "char_start": 863, "char_end": 885}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "分了就又有机会谈恋爱了，也不错呀。", "char_start": 886, "char_end": 903}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 22}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0256"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么有的女人会甘愿当情妇？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021"], "summary": "围绕“不问原因”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“老实说，“为什么有的人xxx”这系列的问题，根本是没法回答的。因为人做事的动机过于复杂，而且人也显然不总是明智和理性的，这类问题根本就没有什么确定的答案。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "老实说，“为什么有的人xxx”这系列的问题，根本是没法回答的。因为人做事的动机过于复杂，而且人也显然不总是明智和理性的，这类问题根本就没有什么确定的答案。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 77, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "30ca33c1-8137-5da4-b10d-6dea23b2db99", "source_ordinal": 2374, "reading_ordinal": 1680, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "尽全力", "published_at": "2023-03-04T02:32:45+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/587031918/answer/2920424011"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "如果现在要求你“使出全力做一条火腿”——", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这是否意味着你应该把银行账户清空去买个十万斤盐来腌它？是否意味着你应该放弃睡眠，蹲在发酵堆旁等它成熟？", "char_start": 21, "char_end": 72}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "战争并不是一件类似砍树那样的活动——只要你用的斧头更大点，抡得更圆点，树就倒得快一点。", "char_start": 73, "char_end": 116}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "战争——尤其是打算根本性改变态势的征服性战争——更像是做火腿、酿酒，时间本身就是原料之一。", "char_start": 117, "char_end": 162}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "什么时候该突袭，什么时候该防御，什么时候该围困，什么时候该消耗，什么时候该歼灭，都有时间上的考量。", "char_start": 163, "char_end": 212}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "并不是抹一斤盐就要等三个月，抹三十斤盐就可以明天好。", "char_start": 213, "char_end": 239}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "抹三十斤盐，东西直接就毁了，到时候“拿水泡淡点”是行不通的。", "char_start": 240, "char_end": 270}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "耐心和适度是“尽全力”的一部分，几乎总是如此。", "char_start": 271, "char_end": 294}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "下次再有人以“没有筋疲力竭”和“没有倾家荡产”来断言你没尽全力的时候，记住这一点。", "char_start": 295, "char_end": 336}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "简单来说——", "char_start": 338, "char_end": 344}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "俄罗斯是否还有更大的火力和战争资源没有倾倒在乌克兰头上？——有，而且不少。", "char_start": 345, "char_end": 382}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "俄罗斯有没有尽全力？——尽了。", "char_start": 383, "char_end": 398}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "将这些尚未使用的火力和资源留在乌克兰和西方集团筋疲力竭的阶段，本身就是理性上更明智的安排。", "char_start": 399, "char_end": 444}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这两者没有矛盾。", "char_start": 445, "char_end": 453}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 15}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0256"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：迄今为止，俄罗斯在乌克兰有没有使出全力？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014"], "summary": "围绕“尽全力”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“如果现在要求你“使出全力做一条火腿”——”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "如果现在要求你“使出全力做一条火腿”——", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "23b568e7-0627-5827-9179-d8020272305d", "source_ordinal": 2373, "reading_ordinal": 1681, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "慕强", "published_at": "2023-03-04T03:15:13+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/395222400/answer/2920433763"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "慕强是自然法的强制命令。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 12}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "不慕强的动物面临最基本的种群劣化问题，基本上只有“一次往海里排一亿个卵”这种“量产型”生物不慕强。", "char_start": 13, "char_end": 62}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "一生只生十几个后代的动物，如果不慕强，从数学上讲，能撑住上百万年不灭绝，着实需要很强的运气。", "char_start": 63, "char_end": 109}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "不慕强的社会也同理，在慕强的社会面前不堪一击。", "char_start": 110, "char_end": 133}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "自然法的判决大于一切自作聪明的意识形态，所以你不需要在这个问题上有任何纠结。", "char_start": 134, "char_end": 172}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "仰慕、追随、模仿、亲近强者，属于完全健康的行为模式，没有任何可羞愧、犹豫之处。", "char_start": 173, "char_end": 212}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "问题根本不出在慕强这个原则上。", "char_start": 213, "char_end": 228}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "而出在对“强者”的准确判断上，出在误以为衣着光鲜的、玉堂金马的、风姿绰约的、前呼后拥的、张牙舞爪的、挥金如土的、残忍无情的、奸诈狡猾的、身强力壮的就叫做“强”。", "char_start": 229, "char_end": 309}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "“强”的特征不在于这些东西，而在于敢于爱。", "char_start": 310, "char_end": 331}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这些光鲜亮丽的东西若非用于爱，反而往往是因为恐惧无爱而发生的过度补偿，恰恰是脆弱的证明。", "char_start": 332, "char_end": 376}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "心狠手辣的、无毒不丈夫的，简直弱得可怜。", "char_start": 377, "char_end": 397}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "第二个问题是出在误以为奉承、贿赂、勾引是和强者建立羁绊的最好手段甚至不二法门。", "char_start": 399, "char_end": 438}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这同样是对真正的强没有概念的可悲误解。", "char_start": 439, "char_end": 458}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "真正的强者对这些“买关系”的伎俩洞若观火，每天都见到不知道多少。", "char_start": 459, "char_end": 491}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "不带任何偏见地说——问题不出在这样的行为是否道德，而在于这样做意味着你本身不知道什么是真正的强大，意味着你自己不知道作为强者的伙伴——即另一个强者——你该有什么样的自觉，意味着接纳你为伙伴、在紧要关头依赖你，于自己、于自己的所有伙伴、于自己所庇护的人，都是一种无谓的潜在风险。", "char_start": 492, "char_end": 630}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "No judgement here, but man, it simply does not work.", "char_start": 631, "char_end": 683}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "所以你越是用这些手段去“慕”，你越可能是在设祭招鬼。", "char_start": 684, "char_end": 710}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "结果总是倾家荡产巴结一个心狠手辣的胆小鬼，一有任何动静就把你丢给猎人换逃生时间。", "char_start": 711, "char_end": 751}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "世界上的人，绝不是“太过慕强”，而是既不知强，也不识慕，却要拿着这个完全背道而驰的蠢行，挂上“慕强”的名头胡作非为，胡说八道。", "char_start": 753, "char_end": 816}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "What a poetic irony.", "char_start": 817, "char_end": 837}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 22}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0256"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何看待很慕强的人?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020"], "summary": "围绕“慕强”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“慕强是自然法的强制命令。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "慕强是自然法的强制命令。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 12, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "fef39e5c-088f-56ee-9747-f9c8d4629f38", "source_ordinal": 2372, "reading_ordinal": 1682, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "天下无魔", "published_at": "2023-03-04T18:04:03+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/586382932/answer/2921257434"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "有一根线，为了自己的心理健康计，最好不要越过。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "那就是不要把任何人非人化。", "char_start": 24, "char_end": 37}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "最典型的表现，就是给人取一些非人的代号，例如“绿茶x”、“x畜生”、“老阴x”、“变态爬床女”、“舔狗”……等等等等。", "char_start": 38, "char_end": 97}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "不仅仅是不能在公开场合、在别人面前这么干，而且在人背后、甚至在自己心里也不能这么干。", "char_start": 98, "char_end": 140}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "腹诽都不可以。", "char_start": 141, "char_end": 148}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "为什么呢？", "char_start": 149, "char_end": 154}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "因为你一旦允许自己在任何意义上这么做，你就要面对一个逻辑上的深渊。", "char_start": 155, "char_end": 188}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "一个人的行为是有合理范围的，而一个“变态”、“畜生”的行为空间可就无法预料了。", "char_start": 189, "char_end": 228}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "而这时你却将这个“变态”、“畜生”视为你的敌人。", "char_start": 229, "char_end": 253}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "于是你立刻就把自己逼死了——你给自己制造了一个“动于九天之上，藏于九地之下，有神鬼莫测之机，不可以常理度之”的魔鬼。", "char_start": 254, "char_end": 312}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "一个神志正常但凶恶的敌人，你可以说服，可以谈判，可以威胁、可以诱骗、可以对抗……办法很多。", "char_start": 313, "char_end": 358}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "但是一个“变态”、一个“畜生”，没准越疼越兴奋，越夜越精神，玩得就是濒死的刺激，毫无道德的顾忌，甚至不具备足以引起合理恐惧的理性，这要怎么对付？", "char_start": 359, "char_end": 431}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "任何妖魔化对手的人，都首先要面对这个逻辑打击——看似给对手加了个恶谥，但实际上却将对手鬼神化了，然后被这个鬼神的无孔不入吓得瑟瑟发抖，惶惶不可终日。", "char_start": 432, "char_end": 506}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "对方甚至毫无察觉，不需要做任何额外的工作，已经对你造成了巨大的精神攻击。", "char_start": 507, "char_end": 543}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "我正奇怪我的气球飞哪去了，你那边隐身战斗机和导弹都用掉了。我一门心思物美价廉，你就喊着要把路由器换个遍。我打着电话从门口过，你连尿都吓停了。我刚上飞机，你就开始写遗书。", "char_start": 544, "char_end": 628}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这种恐怖威胁，造成的都是实打实的伤害，都要花你几千几万的心理治疗成本来修复。", "char_start": 629, "char_end": 667}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你不花这个成本，在自己的灵魂上只打洞不修补，搞久了必然要得抑郁症。", "char_start": 668, "char_end": 701}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "道理就是这么朴素。", "char_start": 702, "char_end": 711}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "无论你有多大的意见，别把人不当人看，别用“妖魔化”当成一种“反击”，否则你必定要受到这个规律的自动反噬。", "char_start": 712, "char_end": 764}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "这不是什么人给你设下的阴谋，而是这个世界在创造人类时就在人的构造里埋下的禁制令。", "char_start": 765, "char_end": 805}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "它完全自动的、如影随形的伴随妖魔化的程度自然加深。", "char_start": 806, "char_end": 831}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "妖魔化一分，就恐惧一分。", "char_start": 832, "char_end": 844}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "妖魔化十分，就恐惧十二万分。", "char_start": 845, "char_end": 859}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "量大不但不打折，罚款还要超级加倍。", "char_start": 860, "char_end": 877}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "这啥意思？这摆明就是“不许”的意思。", "char_start": 878, "char_end": 896}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "无论你想什么办法——哪怕你准备明刀明枪发动特别军事行动都好——都不要想这种“办法”。", "char_start": 898, "char_end": 940}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "因为绝对的得不偿失。", "char_start": 941, "char_end": 951}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 28}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0256"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：体制内已经10年，看领导同事都处于无比恶心，糟心，抑郁，想丢手雷的状态，如何度过后面的20多年？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027"], "summary": "围绕“天下无魔”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“有一根线，为了自己的心理健康计，最好不要越过。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "有一根线，为了自己的心理健康计，最好不要越过。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "45fbd45d-3b8d-56ec-9c0b-c6085e717615", "source_ordinal": 2371, "reading_ordinal": 1683, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "误食", "published_at": "2023-03-05T01:32:54+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/576208509/answer/2921750344"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "醋、酒、酱都是粮食水果保存过期发现的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "臭豆腐、臭干子、臭腐乳、霉千张、霉干菜、鱼露、乳酪、酸奶、泡菜，也是保存失当发现的。", "char_start": 20, "char_end": 62}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "风干肉/菜/海产、盐腌肉/菜、熏肉熏鱼，道理也相同。", "char_start": 63, "char_end": 89}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "还有冻梨、冻豆腐。", "char_start": 90, "char_end": 99}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "还有盐蛋、皮蛋。", "char_start": 100, "char_end": 108}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "仔细算算，已经不知几百种了。", "char_start": 109, "char_end": 123}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "基本上，不动火、不动刀的非鲜货都多少有这个干系。", "char_start": 124, "char_end": 148}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 7}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0256"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：有哪些食物是因为制作失误才被发明出来的？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007"], "summary": "围绕“误食”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“醋、酒、酱都是粮食水果保存过期发现的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "醋、酒、酱都是粮食水果保存过期发现的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "83216918-10ca-50fe-8096-ba513caaa278", "source_ordinal": 2370, "reading_ordinal": 1684, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "最佳实践", "published_at": "2023-03-05T02:17:12+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/587292013/answer/2921769076"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "“理论和实践相结合”是一句说烂了的老话。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "谁都知道“理论一定要和实践相结合”，但是一到应用了，就有人要抓狂——", "char_start": 21, "char_end": 55}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "如果完全按照理论实践，基本上等于睁着眼睛往理论上不存在但山风吹得裤裆发凉的悬崖下跳。", "char_start": 56, "char_end": 98}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "但是如果你不跳，那又是明晃晃的、不由分说的背叛理论。", "char_start": 99, "char_end": 125}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这情况几乎在所有的社会伦理、管理实践、运营实践里都存在，想不通这个关节，那迟早人要么被撕成两半——说一套做一套；要么就反智化——抛弃、鄙视甚至仇视一切理论，冠以“真空里的球形鸡”称号；要么就玄化——化身自言自语的晦涩之神，只醉心于创造精巧的自洽体系，只要老妈还不赶出门，洒家已经不再以红尘俗世为意了。", "char_start": 126, "char_end": 276}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这问题在哪？", "char_start": 277, "char_end": 283}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "在于一个关键的要害上——人类对理论的正确实践，在客观上就仅能限于“尽可能”三字而已。", "char_start": 284, "char_end": 326}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "“尽可能不杀人”就是人类对不可杀人的理想实践。", "char_start": 327, "char_end": 350}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "“尽可能不欺瞒”，就是人类对不可欺骗的理想实践。", "char_start": 351, "char_end": 375}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "“尽可能不偏私”，就是人类对不可偏私的理想实践。", "char_start": 376, "char_end": 400}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "看清楚，理想实践——ideal，至高、最佳、极致了。", "char_start": 401, "char_end": 427}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这话具体是什么意思？", "char_start": 428, "char_end": 438}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "意思是你要停止指责人“没有实践xxx原则”，而要转而仅仅关注“是否还有进一步贯彻xxx的空间”。", "char_start": 439, "char_end": 487}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "对人类而言，只有通过证明“明知还存在着进一步逼近的空间但却拒绝前进”，才构成合理的过失和罪行，才能产生真正有力、有价值的批判。", "char_start": 488, "char_end": 551}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你要转变你的过失观——", "char_start": 552, "char_end": 563}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "没有做到、没有实现，并不为过失，并不产生可追究的责任和罪。", "char_start": 564, "char_end": 593}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "有显著的努力空间，但却有意不去极尽这个可能，这才构成可以追究的责任和罪。", "char_start": 594, "char_end": 630}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "罪的根据，并非来自“未能符合理想”，而仅仅来自“未尽可能”。", "char_start": 631, "char_end": 661}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "你要学会接受和赞赏人们善尽的可能，并且停止不自觉的将“没有达成理想状态”视为“背叛理想”。", "char_start": 662, "char_end": 707}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "善尽可能，就是人类对理想最大可能的热爱。", "char_start": 708, "char_end": 728}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "相信和遵循这样的过失观，则是理想对人类最大可能的热爱。", "char_start": 729, "char_end": 756}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "此念一通，云开雾散。", "char_start": 757, "char_end": 767}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 22}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0256"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何看待罗翔评「一人犯罪影响家属考公」，称「不能突破『无罪不罚』这个底线」？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022"], "summary": "围绕“最佳实践”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：““理论和实践相结合”是一句说烂了的老话。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "“理论和实践相结合”是一句说烂了的老话。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "23791905-d312-5396-81b0-0749eac16494", "source_ordinal": 2369, "reading_ordinal": 1685, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "增材制造", "published_at": "2023-03-05T03:20:11+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/463955482/answer/2921786436"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "最大的用处是可以实现很多之前必须靠焊接、铆接、粘合……实现的拼接结构。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 35}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这其中最典型的就是流体管路。", "char_start": 36, "char_end": 50}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "举点最简单的例子——人的心脏就是无法一次成型制造的。无论是什么样的减材切削工具，都没有能力规划出全部的进刀排屑路线。不管是什么样的铸造模具，都没有办法设计恰当的脱模方案。", "char_start": 51, "char_end": 136}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "在增材加工方式之前，这种构造只能被分解为几个部件然后进行装配拼接。", "char_start": 137, "char_end": 170}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这就带来了巨大的额外成本——", "char_start": 172, "char_end": 186}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "1）为了能很好的装配，加工公差和装配误差就很容易苛刻到几乎不现实。有限的高级技师和精密设备数量极大的限制了产能上限。", "char_start": 187, "char_end": 245}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "稍微复杂的一点的构造——例如发动机气缸——都需要一整条生产线甚至一整个生态链去维护。", "char_start": 246, "char_end": 288}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "然而讽刺的是——倘若一开始这东西就是一体的，反而对误差的要求会下降。", "char_start": 289, "char_end": 323}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "人类的心脏就是公差极大的东西，但却工作得很好，远不像发动机那样稍微有点偏差就要滋滋冒油。", "char_start": 324, "char_end": 368}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这部分精细工作实际上是浪费掉了，但因为没有替代手段，没有办法只能硬抗。", "char_start": 369, "char_end": 404}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "2）产生了无数实际上根本只是作为静态框架参与运作的“零件”。为生产管理的整个过程带来了大量的额外复杂性和设计、加工、装配成本，也为产品的整个生命周期带来巨大的维护成本。", "char_start": 406, "char_end": 490}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "二十六个部件拼接起来的心脏，无故障运行的时间大概还不够你活到会叫妈。", "char_start": 491, "char_end": 525}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "3）为了迁就“加工难度太大”的问题，整个系统都在为加工技术的不足付出代价。", "char_start": 526, "char_end": 563}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "因为没法加工，所以发动机才被设计成现在这个方头大耳、浑身针筒的样子。而又因为它是这样，机舱布局、油路传动才是现在的样子。", "char_start": 564, "char_end": 624}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这类问题普遍存在，牵一发而动全身。", "char_start": 625, "char_end": 642}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "有了可靠的增材制造，整个问题都有希望获得改观。", "char_start": 643, "char_end": 666}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "4）增材制造几乎没有内应力残留问题。", "char_start": 667, "char_end": 685}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这一条很多人做梦都想笑醒。", "char_start": 686, "char_end": 699}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "内应力对大型设备就是魔鬼。美军的坦克放在沙漠里一放几十年，就是为了想办法释放内应力。", "char_start": 700, "char_end": 742}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "否则巨大的焊接框架其实一直在轻微的扭动。", "char_start": 743, "char_end": 763}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "这可不是开玩笑——装备尺度如果大了，稍微蠕变一点，车身接炮塔的大圆环都会变形。甚至干脆扭成不共面的“♾️”形。这对坦克炮的精度和有效射程有甚至炮塔的运作都有复杂的影响——每辆坦克都扭得不一致，而且还在持续变形，意味着每辆坦克的火炮都要进行定期调校和维护。", "char_start": 764, "char_end": 891}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "于是实在不如先把你扔在沙漠里等你自己先变形完毕，活活把重工业搞成酿造业。", "char_start": 892, "char_end": 928}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "总之，增材加工技术对工程师属于圆梦级的美事。", "char_start": 929, "char_end": 951}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "说得不客气点——光刻机的难度都因为它下降了，很多之前的挖空心思要解决的误差问题，维护问题，都可能因为复杂结构的一体成型技术被从根源上消灭。", "char_start": 953, "char_end": 1022}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "总之，是好东西。", "char_start": 1023, "char_end": 1031}], "images": [{"image_id": "IMG001", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2023-03/04/c559a0d90f17f6d29cf327d1d31f3d68.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG002", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2023-03/04/e77a64f6c3f043bc8ae53e60a069bcd7.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 30, "image": 2}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "needs_reread", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0256"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：3D打印技术最大的用处是什么？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025"], "summary": "围绕“增材制造”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“最大的用处是可以实现很多之前必须靠焊接、铆接、粘合……实现的拼接结构。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "最大的用处是可以实现很多之前必须靠焊接、铆接、粘合……实现的拼接结构。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 35, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。 含图片节点，图片未经核验。"}
